      "text": "Section 1. Section 3(c) of Executive Order 13282 is amended to read as \nfollows: \n‘‘(c) Justices and judges (28 U.S.C. 5, 44(d), 135, 252, and 461(a), section \n140 of Public Law 97–92, and Public Law 108–6) at Schedule 7.’’."
